# Long-range LD regions excluded before LD pruning / PCA.
#
# This is the widely-circulated PLINK "high-LD regions" list (after Price et
# al. 2008, Am J Hum Genet 83:132-135, Table 1). The coordinates as published
# are build 36; the list below is the hg19/build 37 form that ships with most
# PCA workflows. Boundaries are approximate by design — these are generous
# windows meant to be over- rather than under-inclusive, so small build-
# coordinate drift at the edges does not matter in practice.
#
# Bare contig naming (1, not chr1) to match the rest of this repo.
# Format: CHROM  START  END  NAME   (0-based half-open, BED convention)
1	48000000	52000000	hla_unrelated_1p
2	86000000	100500000	region_2p
2	134500000	138000000	region_2q_lct
2	183000000	190000000	region_2q
3	47500000	50000000	region_3p
3	83500000	87000000	region_3p_2
3	89000000	97500000	region_3q
5	44500000	50500000	region_5p
5	98000000	100500000	region_5q
5	129000000	132000000	region_5q_2
5	135500000	138500000	region_5q_3
6	25000000	33500000	MHC
6	57000000	64000000	region_6p_centromeric
6	140000000	142500000	region_6q
7	55000000	66000000	region_7_centromeric
8	7000000	13000000	inversion_8p23
8	43000000	50000000	region_8_centromeric
8	112000000	115000000	region_8q
10	37000000	43000000	region_10_centromeric
11	46000000	57000000	region_11_centromeric
11	87500000	90500000	region_11q
12	33000000	40000000	region_12_centromeric
12	109500000	112000000	region_12q
20	32000000	34500000	region_20_centromeric
